r Round 3, to re-check once MCC publishes it. The [MCC schedule notice](https://cdnbbsr.s3waas.gov.in/s3e0f7a4d0ef9b84b83b693bbf3feb8e6e/uploads/2026/11/20261107776874972.pdf) has the dates.\n\nBased on this round's seat lists:\n- **MD Anaesthesiology at government colleges (All India quota):** none reached 25,000 in R1 or R2 in recent years. **35 reached it only in R3** and 31 only in stray. Clear seats are down: 254 now vs 330 in 2025 R2.\n- **DNB Anaesthesiology (DNB Quota):** 289 options are \"likely\", mostly corporate and trust hospitals whose 2026 R1 closing went past your rank. Clear seats are 284 now vs 434 in 2025 R2 (−35%).\n- **Deemed MD:** 53 options are \"likely\", but the fees are very high. VELS, for example, is ₹35 L with a leaving penalty of up to ₹2.1 Cr.\n\n*How the bands work: \"likely\" means your rank fell within an R1/R2 closing in 2+ recent years or in 2026 R1. \"Possible\" means it was reached in R3, or closed within 10% of your rank. \"Long shot\" means it was reached only in stray.*\n\n### Possible: MD at government colleges, reached in 2025 R3\n| College | Trend (R1) | 2025 R3 | Bond / penalty |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [GMC Rajnandgaon (Atal Bihari Vajpayee)](/decide/institutes/gmc-bharat-ratna-late-shri-atal-bihari-vajpayee-memorial-medical-college-491441?tab=courses), CG | ↑ 18,137 → 22,737 | 29,960 | 2Y / ₹50 L |\n| [GMC Ratlam](/decide/institutes/government-medical-college-ratlam-457001?tab=courses), MP | ↑ 17,375 → 21,165 | 25,556 | 1Y / ₹10 L |\n| [Dr Shankarrao Chavan GMC (Nanded)](/decide/institutes/dr-shankarrao-chavan-government-medical-college-431606?tab=courses), MH | ↑ 16,571 → 17,578 | 25,523 | 1Y / ₹50 L |\n| [Shaikh-Ul-Hind MC (Saharanpur)](/decide/institutes/shaikh-ul-hind-maulana-mahmood-hasan-medical-college-247232?tab=courses), UP | ↑ 17,325 → 19,336 | 23,736 | 2Y / ₹40 L |\n\nSaharanpur also has **+3 clear seats** compared with 2025 R2.\n\n### Long shots: MD reached only in 2025 stray\nJNMC Aligarh (stray 27,756; **no bond**), PDU Rajkot (32,533), MLB Jhansi (30,587), GMC Patiala (33,727), SP Bikaner (29,859), BJ Ahmedabad (28,017; 7 clear seats).\n\n### Likely: DNB with no bond, fee ≤ ₹1.25 L\n| Hospital | Trend (R1) | 2026 R1 | Stipend |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [Medanta](/decide/institutes/medanta-hospital-226030?tab=courses), UP | → 24,339 → 25,416 | 25,416 | ₹65,000 |\n| [Fortis Memorial, Gurgaon](/decide/institutes/fortis-memorial-research-institute-gurgaon-122002?tab=courses) | only 1 year of data | 26,176 | ₹57,000 |\n| [KIMS Kondapur](/decide/institutes/kims-hospital-kondapur-500084?tab=courses) | ↑ 22,238 → 26,735 | 26,735 | ₹67,032 |\n| [Yashoda Somajiguda](/decide/institutes/yashoda-super-speciality-hospital-somajiguda-500082?tab=courses) | ↑ 23,827 → 26,574 | 26,574 | ₹67,032 |\n| [Manipal Rustom Bagh](/decide/institutes/manipal-hospital-rustom-bagh-560017?tab=courses) | ↑ 24,706 → 25,155 | 25,155 | ₹56,250 |\n| [Metas Adventist](/decide/institutes/metas-adventist-hospital-395001?tab=courses), Surat | ↑ 21,669 → 26,288 | 26,288 | ₹84,000 |\n| [Apollo Adlux](/decide/institutes/apollo-adlux-hospital-a-unit-of-adlux-medicity-and-convention-centre-private-limited-683576?tab=courses), Kerala | ↑ 21,060 → 25,882 | 25,882 | ₹60,000 |\n| [Little Flower](/decide/institutes/little-flower-hospital-and-research-centre-683572?tab=courses) / [Mar Sleeva](/decide/institutes/mar-sleeva-medicity-palai-686584?tab=courses), Kerala | ↑ | 25,960 / 25,381 | ₹55,120 / ₹60,000 |\n\nSt. Stephen's Delhi (DNB, no bond) was reached only in 2025 R3, at 25,628. Treat it as \"possible\".\n\n## My recommendation for Round 3\n1. **At the top:** the MD government seats you would genuinely join, starting with the 4 \"possible\" ones above. Put the stray-only long shots above them only if you'd accept their bond. A **Round 3 seat is final**: you can't resign it or upgrade from it.\n2. **Then:** your preferred no-bond DNB hospitals, in the order you'd actually want them, with St. Stephen's near the top.\n3. **Leave out:** anything you wouldn't join. GMERS Porbandar and Morbi pay ₹35,000, which is below the NBEMS minimum, and their bond is not published in the documents Seatora has. Leave out deemed MD too unless ₹35 L-level fees are acceptable.\n\n**Checklist**\n- Fill many choices. There's no penalty for a long list.\n- Order by what you'd join, not by your chances.\n- Check the bond and leaving penalty before you add any MD seat.\n- Keep your state-quota counselling running as a backup.\n- Lock your choices well before the deadline.\n\n**Two quick questions:** Did you take a seat in Round 1 or 2? And do you prefer MD over DNB? Once the Round 3 seats are out, shall I lay this out as your full ordered list and save it to your Choices?\n\nHistory, not a prediction."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":19916,"cache_read_input_tokens":6920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":19916,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3355,"service_tier":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":944}},"parsed_output":null}}]